This directory contains Alembic configuration for managing database schema
migrations for the Bars backend.

To create a new revision after installing Alembic in your environment:

    alembic -c backend/alembic.ini revision -m "description"

To upgrade the database to the latest revision:

    alembic -c backend/alembic.ini upgrade head

The env.py file is wired to use the application's async SQLAlchemy models via
the shared engine and Base metadata in app.database.

